  "findings": {
    "recovery": "The admission test counted 97 rejections rather than 96. The prior harness read the renamed recovery file without waiting for the native durability acknowledgment. One earlier operation occupying a slot is a hypothesis, not directly captured in this artifact. The fix waits for a real FIFO recovery acknowledgment before holding the next write; the exact four accepted/96 rejected assertion is unchanged. Failed future attempts retain individual outcomes.",
